# Starry-Eyed Skyrider: "Whenever this creature attacks, another target creature you control gains flying until end of turn"
# and "Attacking tokens you control have flying". On turn 1 Bot1 casts Memnite and the Skyrider ({2}{W}). On turn 3 it makes
# a Soldier token with Riling Dawnbreaker's Omen, Signaling Roar, and attacks with the Skyrider alone: the trigger's
# candidates are the Soldier and Memnite, and Memnite is chosen. In combat Memnite has flying and the Soldier, which is a
# token but not attacking, has none (the refusal). The flying from the trigger ended with the turn. On turn 5 Memnite and the
# Soldier attack: the token has flying and Memnite, which is no token and is not the trigger's target, has not (the refusal).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Starry-Eyed Skyrider
Riling Dawnbreaker
Memnite
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

